amate Center, the controlling shareholder of NexAI Digital (MGLV), sold an additional 38.5 million shares on 11 September 2026 at roughly Rp7,000 per share, generating proceeds of about Rp269.5 billion. The sale price represented a discount of approximately 8,300 points, or 54.25%, compared with the closing price of Rp15,300 on that day. After the transaction, Nextier’s holding in NexAI Digital fell to 1.2 billion shares, or 63.07% of the total, a decline of 2.03 percentage points from the prior 65.10% stake. This follows an earlier sale of 35 million shares on 8 September 2026 at the same price, which raised Rp245 billion, and comes after a special shareholders’ meeting on 7 September 2026 that approved a right issue of up to 285.73 million new shares, the sale of subsidiaries, and the appointment of Widjono Hardjanto as an independent commissioner.', '14325', null, null, '240.933189644863', '-7.036964099740121', '0.4660885968947598', '127866478461', '-9019490202', '1.98839023629211', '0.899951108960617', '-0.7951634552487773', '0.7544923872049336', null, 'netral', 'di bawah sektor', 'wajar', '{"peers":[{"peers_data":{"companies":[{"year":2025,"group":["self"],"pb_mrq":245.558434123211,"pe_ttm":null,"symbol":"MGLV.JK","market_cap":27811297800600,"net_income":-9019490202,"company_name":"PT Panca Anugrah Wisesa Tbk","employee_num":null,"total_assets":187913019699,"total_equity":128173031355,"pretax_income":-8379248414,"total_revenue":127866478461,"point_summaries":[{"name":"value","point":2,"maxpoint":15},{"name":"competitive","point":13.5,"maxpoint":21},{"name":"future","point":0,"maxpoint":0},{"name":"financials","point":2,"maxpoint":7.5},{"name":"dividend","point":1.5,"maxpoint":15.5},{"updatedAt":"2026-09-15T23:01:12.530Z"}],"yearly_mcap_chg":12.9047619047619,"operating_expense":54260987410,"revenue_breakdown":null,"total_liabilities":59739988344,"int_income_breakdown":null,"operating_expense_breakdown":null},{"year":2025,"group":["sub_sector","sector","industry"